### ===== Sprints 2 et 3 : tests de l'API (IntelliJ HTTP Client) =====
### Utilise deux comptes : un conducteur (karim) et un passager (salma).
### Les variables {{tokenKarim}}, {{tokenSalma}}, {{tokenAdmin}}, {{tripId}}, {{bookingId}} sont remplies automatiquement.

### 0. Inscription des deux comptes (ignore l'erreur 409 s'ils existent déjà)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Karim Ben Ali", "email": "karim@test.tn", "phone": "22123456", "password": "Password1" }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Salma Trabelsi", "email": "salma@test.tn", "phone": "55123456", "password": "Password1" }

### Connexion de Karim (conducteur)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "karim@test.tn", "password": "Password1" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenKarim", response.body.token); %}

### Connexion de Salma (passagère)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "salma@test.tn", "password": "Password1" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenSalma", response.body.token); %}

### Connexion de l'admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@covoiturage.tn", "password": "Admin@12345" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenAdmin", response.body.token); %}

### ===================== SPRINT 2 : trajets =====================

### Karim ajoute un véhicule
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "brand": "Peugeot", "model": "208", "color": "Gris", "seats": 4 }

> {% client.global.set("vehicleId", response.body.id); %}

### F09 : autocomplétion d'adresses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/maps/geocode?query=manou
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}

### F10 : itinéraire + prix suggéré (Ariana -> La Manouba, 3 places)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/maps/route?fromLat=36.8665&fromLng=10.1647&toLat=36.8101&toLng=10.0863&seats=3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}

### F08 : Karim publie un trajet (change la date : elle doit être dans le futur)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{vehicleId}},
  "departureAddress": "Ariana, Tunisie", "departureLat": 36.8665, "departureLng": 10.1647,
  "arrivalAddress": "La Manouba, Tunisie", "arrivalLat": 36.8101, "arrivalLng": 10.0863,
  "departureDateTime": "2027-01-15T07:30:00",
  "totalSeats": 3, "pricePerSeat": 1.0
}

> {% client.global.set("tripId", response.body[0].id); %}

### F15 : trajets récurrents (lundi et mercredi pendant 4 semaines)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{vehicleId}},
  "departureAddress": "Ariana, Tunisie", "departureLat": 36.8665, "departureLng": 10.1647,
  "arrivalAddress": "La Manouba, Tunisie", "arrivalLat": 36.8101, "arrivalLng": 10.0863,
  "departureDateTime": "2027-01-18T08:00:00",
  "totalSeats": 2, "pricePerSeat": 1.0,
  "recurrenceWeekdays": [1, 3], "recurrenceWeeks": 4
}

### F12 : Salma recherche par texte
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/search?from=ariana&to=manouba&date=2027-01-15&seats=1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}

### F14 : Salma recherche avec coordonnées (matching par détour, 5 km max)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/search?fromLat=36.8665&fromLng=10.1647&toLat=36.8101&toLng=10.0863&maxDetourKm=5&sort=detour
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}

### Détail du trajet avec l'itinéraire (F16)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}

### Mes trajets (conducteur)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}

### F11 : modifier le trajet
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "departureDateTime": "2027-01-15T08:00:00", "totalSeats": 3, "pricePerSeat": 1.2 }

### ===================== SPRINT 3 : réservations =====================

### F17 : Salma demande 2 places
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "seats": 2 }

> {% client.global.set("bookingId", response.body.id); %}

### RG3 : même demande une 2e fois -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "seats": 1 }

### RG2 : Karim réserve son propre trajet -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "seats": 1 }

### Demandes reçues par Karim
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/received
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}

### F18 : Karim accepte (il reste 1 place)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}

### F21 : réservations de Salma (téléphones visibles après acceptation)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}

### F19 : Salma annule (les places sont rendues)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}

### F22 : Karim démarre puis termine le trajet (nécessaire pour les avis)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "IN_PROGRESS" }

###
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/trips/{{tripId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenKarim}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DONE" }

### F24 : Salma note Karim (réservation acceptée + trajet terminé)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5, "comment": "Conducteur ponctuel et sympathique" }

### Avis reçus par un utilisateur (remplace 2 par l'id de Karim)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/2/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}

### ===================== ADMINISTRATION =====================

### F26 : liste des utilisateurs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### Bloquer l'utilisateur 3 (RG9 : il ne pourra plus se connecter)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/3/block
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/3/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### F28 : statistiques
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### F27 : trajets et avis à modérer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### Un utilisateur normal sur /api/admin -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSalma}}
